        <item>
            <title>0.1.14</title>
            <description sparkle:format="html"><![CDATA[
                <h3>What's new in 0.1.14</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Reduced memory use when opening the dashboard and switching tabs by using bounded SQL projections and aggregated timing metrics.</li>
                    <li>Added pagination for model and project session data, and limited Overview to the information it displays.</li>
                    <li>Improved menu-bar refresh behavior, provider quota handling, and persisted metrics updates.</li>
                    <li>Refined dashboard charts, project views, and pricing display.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
